          "items": [
            "Perfect for reunions and large gatherings — SUMMER PACE is a single-family, 12‑bedroom home south of 30A with private gated beach access, a heated private pool, two kitchens, abundant indoor/outdoor space, and parking for 5–7 cars. Walk to the sand (under a minute) and enjoy easy access to Seaside (2 miles) and Rosemary Beach (6 miles).<br><br>Top highlights<br>\t•\tSleeps 27: 12 bedrooms, 6 full baths + 4 half baths<br>\t•\tPrivate heated pool, outdoor gas grill, poolside dining<br>\t•\tTwo fully equipped kitchens and ice maker<br>\t•\tGated neighborhood with exclusive boardwalk to a private beach (minimal crowds)<br>\t•\tCovered parking for 5–7 cars, steps to local restaurants and convenience store<br>\t•\tFamily-friendly layout with TVs throughout, kids’ spaces, and plenty of seating<br><br>Sleeping overview<br>\t•\tGround level: 1 king en suite (private bath)<br>\t•\tMain level: 1 king en suite + wide open living/dining/kitchen areas with dual kitchens<br>\t•\tThird level (two sides — Beachside & North Breeze): Ten bedrooms total (mixed kings, queens, twins, built-in bunks) — each side supports large group sleeping comfortably<br><br>Location & convenience<br>\t•\tLess than a 1‑minute walk to private Seashore Village beach (exclusive private gate access)<br>\t•\tShort drive/bike to Seaside (2 miles) and Rosemary Beach (6 miles)<br>\t•\tNearby: state parks, golf courses, marinas, Publix (~2 miles), and local dining<br>\t•\tCross 30A to access miles of hiking and scenic trails<br><br>Guest care & policies<br>\t•\t100% refund for weather related/hurricane closures<br>\t•\tFresh linens & towels sanitized to CDC standards<br>\t•\tFamily Friendly - ideal for families and reunions<br>\t•\tPool can be heated — propane for grill provided<br><br>Booking notes<br>\t•\tPrivate beach chair/umbrella set-up included<br>\t•\tTwo cruiser bikes included<br><br>Ready to host your group!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
